# variation 1 of b20: the right name of the optional parameter (D-133)
** spec: syntax/statements.md#apply
driver b20_test1 is
  process main is
    apply greet("Eve", greeting: "Hi");
    apply greet(who: "Bob", greeting: "Yo");
  return;
end b20_test1;
